# Stale experiments and session-specific material
**/archive/
# Keep curated research docs under snes_oneshot/docs/archive/.
!snes_oneshot/docs/archive/
!snes_oneshot/docs/archive/**
onotes.md
TRAINING_IN_PROGRESS.md
monitor_all_training.sh
*.bak
**/.*_last_*
donkey_kong_country/button
donkey_kong_country/notes
harvest/tasks/

# Super Metroid — recorded policies, maps, vendor refs, local demos.
# Paths use **/super_metroid/ so both legacy root layout and snes/super_metroid/
# are covered. Curated room_clears policies + maps/README stay tracked.
**/super_metroid/policies/*
!**/super_metroid/policies/room_clears/
!**/super_metroid/policies/room_clears/*.json
**/super_metroid/custom_integrations/*/*.provenance.json
**/super_metroid/maps/*
!**/super_metroid/maps/README.md
# Human frame dumps / end states under package tasks/ (not docs/tasks cards)
**/super_metroid/tasks/**
**/super_metroid/refs/sm-json-data/
# YouTube reference VODs + frame/button extracts (local only; large media)
**/super_metroid/refs/yt_reference/
**/super_metroid/docs/tasks/logs/
# Tracked template: **/super_metroid/opencode.example.json — copy to opencode.json locally.
**/super_metroid/opencode.json

# Agent/session configuration and local task databases
.claude/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/.agents.md
**/.bv/
# Beads: track issues.jsonl + config.yaml + metadata; runtime DB/daemon
# ignored via .beads/.gitignore (do not blanket-ignore the directory).

# Third-party/reference source trees are cloned separately.
harvest/HM-Decomp/
uwnh/
super_metroid_rl/
alttp/refs/z3-json-data/
# Workspace-local clone (prefer refs/ via setup script; never commit vendor tree)
alttp/z3-json-data/
smz3/refs/
smz3/seeds/
sm_rando/seeds/
alttp_rando/seeds/
**/seeds/*/
!**/seeds/.gitkeep
SMW/refs/*
!SMW/refs/README.md
SMW/tools/external/*
!SMW/tools/external/README.md

# Other generated build/runtime trees
**/.gradle/
**/boss_data/

